	(text "TPS25751 ADDRESS / DEAD-BATTERY STRAPS (SafeMode)\nPort 1: R1 ADCIN1 = LDO_3V3, R2 ADCIN2 = GND  -> I2C 0x20\nPort 2: R3 ADCIN1 = GND,     R4 ADCIN2 = GND  -> I2C 0x21\nSame SDA/SCL bus (CC2340 I2C0, 100 kHz): gauge BQ40Z50-R2 0x0B, TMP1075 U302-U306 0x48-0x4C"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
